# Firebase Functions
#
# The Gemini key itself lives in Secret Manager and never touches the repo, but
# these files hold project configuration and local credentials that must not be
# committed. `.env*` above already covers functions/.env.<projectId>; the rest
# are listed explicitly rather than relied upon.
functions/node_modules
functions/lib
functions/.env
functions/.env.*
!functions/.env.example
.runtimeconfig.json
firebase-debug.log
firebase-debug.*.log
.firebase/
firestore-debug.log
ui-debug.log
